{
  "info": {
    "name": "Experience API (Toyota)",
    "description": "Collection de teste da Experience API. Sobe com o perfil H2 (banco em memoria) ou Postgres.\n\nComo usar:\n1. Rode a aplicacao: .\\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=h2\n2. Execute o request 'Login (Admin)' primeiro — ele salva o token automaticamente na variavel de colecao {{token}}.\n3. Os demais requests ja usam Authorization: Bearer {{token}}.\n\nCredenciais criadas pelo DataSeeder:\n- admin@experience.com / admin123 (ADMIN)\n- vendedor.toyota@experience.com / vendedor123 (VENDEDOR)\n- ana.souza@email.com ... joao.pereira@email.com / cliente123 (CLIENTE)\n\nVeiculos criados: chassi 10001 a 10010.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token salvo:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@experience.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Vendedor)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"vendedor.toyota@experience.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"vendedor123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (usuario logado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar Usuario (publico)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Novo Vendedor\",\n  \"email\": \"novo.vendedor@experience.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"Senha@123\",\n  \"dataNascimento\": \"1990-05-20\",\n  \"role\": \"VENDEDOR\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario?page=0&size=10", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "10" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar Usuario por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ativar Usuario (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/2/ativar", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "2", "ativar"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desativar Usuario (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuario/2/desativar", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "usuario", "2", "desativar"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
